  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A creature you touch has the &amp;Reference[invisible]{Invisible} condition until the spell ends. The spell ends early immediately after the target makes an attack roll, deals damage, or casts a spell.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 2.</p><p><em>Utility activity applies Invisible status. The effect auto-removes on first attack or spell cast via DAE specialDuration. Scales to additional targets with higher spell slots.</em></p>",
